 diet and this makes me feel energized and on the move. Love the berry flavor, definitely recommend to others.” -Denise"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Allergens: None."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Product of U.S.A. with select ingredients thoughtfully curated from around the world."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: As a nutritional supplement, mix 1 packet in 8-16 oz. of water (or to taste) and stir for 5 seconds once daily. Or use as directed by your healthcare professional."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Should not be used if tamper evident seal is broken."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Albion Minerals\r\nAlbion, TRAACS and the Albion Gold Medallion design are registered trademarks of Albion Laboratories Inc. U.S. Patent No. 7,838,042."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Need more? Call 1-888-352-5050 or visit jigsawhealth.com\r\nThe results are posted on our website for all to see because we believe that what's on the label is what should be in the product, and nothing else."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"We are committed to providing you with highly effective, premium-quality supplements. Every batch of product is tested by an independent 3rd party lab to ensure purity and potency.\r\nIf you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, we offer a 90-day, hassle-free, money-back guarantee."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"90 Day Money-Back Guarantee"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Jigsaw Health\r\nIt's fun to feel good"}],"claims":[{"langualCode"